      "label": "Degrading Humor",
      "description": "The meme relies on shock value and crude humor to elicit a reaction. This type of humor is rooted in real-world cultural phenomena where offensive, vulgar, or demeaning content is used for comedic effect, often at the expense of the subjects' dignity. It is a form of humor that targets the subjects' perceived worth or social status, which is considered harmful and offensive by many.",
