      "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material (top_text) which contains the vulgar and degrading statement 'i bet they make squeaky toy sounds when they fuck.' This projection implies the user is identifying with or imagining themselves as the speaker of this offensive text, thereby internalizing or adopting the degrading perspective. The text is the primary vehicle for the user's projection, as it contains the explicit, vulgar, and infantilizing content that the user is engaging with.",
