      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience for this meme is individuals who are familiar with or enjoy crude, shock-value humor that relies on degrading, infantilizing, and sexual objectification stereotypes. This audience likely appreciates offensive content that uses juxtaposition (e.g., formal historical portraits with vulgar text) to provoke reactions. The meme is designed to appeal to viewers who find humor in demeaning and reducing human subjects to toys or objects, particularly those who are desensitized to or enjoy vulgar language and offensive analogies. The target community may include internet users who engage with edgy, dark humor memes that prioritize shock and degradation over dignity or respect for historical subjects.",
